Z||000000||AusFiero||08-03-2001||01:19 PM||||   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/scoops.jpg">   <P>Ok I have finally priced the side scoops and provided ordering facilities online even though I currently have auto-alley.com down for a rebuild.<P>I have also given a slow shipping option that can save money.<P>Scoop kits will be ready for shipping in 10 to 14 days so I am now taking orders. First in best dressed. Although order 1 has already been taken. The lower skirts will also go online tomorrow, as I am building them now too. <P>First I will explain security at the order page as you will not see an SSL secure page. The store is secured with its own data encryption and it is a system not unlike the American Military use on their sites. Credit card numbers arrive at my end encrypted and sent in 2 parts in case of 1 part getting intercepted. Full numbers are stored on the server, only the last 4 digits which is part of my account area which is currently disabled. There is also a printable order form available for those that do not trust internet security in general.<P>To go to the page for full info of what you get and prices <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com/fierostore/ezistore.cgi?page=AUS001" TARGET=_blank>CLICK HERE NOW</A><P>I have now added the matching lower skirts (see lower on this page for picture) to the store you can get to them from the link above for the scoops, or you can [URL'http://www.auto-alley.com/fierostore/ezistore.cgi?page=AUS002]Click Here[/URL] to go directly to the page for the skirts.<P><BR>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif">    <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A><P><BR><p>[This message has been edited by AusFiero (edited 08-05-2001).]||202.139.20.3||reg||14
