Z||000014||AusFiero||08-04-2001||09:25 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Songman:<BR><B>Looks great, Aus.... Do you have the rockers online yet? Will you be taking PayPal or just VISA/MC? I don't even know if PayPal is available over there....<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Only Mastercard and Visa Songman. We do not have paypal here. I can also accept certified bank cheques if you use the printable order form that is availalbe at the checkout stage of ordering. <P>Anyone elses messages after Songmans I cannot see, even though I know there are some. Will get to them when I can as I am having major internet problems and was lucky to even get to the forum now. Have to talk to my ISP tomorrow about it. I asked Pondski via email to also post a message incase this does not get through.<P>For people that want to see them on a car, well they are still getting made over the next 10 to 14 days But here is a picture of them on a coupe. The lower skirts also pictured will be online today I will post an adress for ordering here also. Late Today.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stage2-1painted_2.jpg"> <P>I am taking orders now so I an sure I am justified in continueing. Seems people like the price and I have enough orders to do it.<BR>I am only asking for a deposit so people do not back out after I spend a lot of money making the stuff. Anyway I am going back out to the garage to continue the project. Will check mail ocassionally to see whats happening.<p>[This message has been edited by AusFiero (edited 08-04-2001).]||||reg||1
