Z||000026||AusFiero||08-05-2001||11:40 PM||||Ok I have weighed up the half door skin as apposed to a replacement for the lower aero ground effects trims on the doors and guards. The half doorskins are going to actually be harder to fit, and manufacture without having a risk of screwing up tolerances, than just making a part that goes along the bottom of your original doors and will mould in easily. Best part, it is going to be a big reduction in price, which I am sure people will be happy about. I will post a new thread soon with the new prices. Unfortunately the side skirts below the doors will rise by about $10 as they are now about 12" to long for the post and will have to be shipped by a courier, even though they told me it was fine on Friday. But that $10 rise will be more than covered by the reduction you are about to see in the cost of the scoops kit. <P>I will notify everyone that has already ordered by email to let them know that their scoop kits are now cheaper and why. They can cancel if they please but I am sure nobody will cancel with less work for fitment and a big discount. <P>The half skin was good in theory but I kept looking at it and getting very worried about the work to fit them correctly as apposed to a very small amount of filling along the lower edge of the door where the new panel aero trim replacement fits on. <P>Ahh the joys of production glitches to sort. Archie asked a lot of questions actually that got me thinking on some other variables (things even he hadn't asked) and got me out to my car and playing with things.<P>Also someone wanted to see a fast back with the scoops and someone also wanted to see a 3/4 view. Well here it is. This car has the scoops only fitted, no new skirts or any other part of the kit.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fastbackscoops_1.jpg"> <P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
